; Leg EN -- EL's control: the same -d receive into A:, WITHOUT edits 23-26.
; START THE VICTOR FIRST; wait for the drive to go quiet.
; The CLOCK IS NOT A RESULT.  The result is the Victor's A:\DEBUG.LOG:
;   - the gtimer jump between the F packet and its ACK (EL read +5 s)
;   - and whether zchko's open/isatty/delete are present (they must be)

set receive confirm off
set exit warning off
set speed 9600
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bdEN.pkt
send rcven.dat
statistics
